  "title": "NexAnnuity Unveils New Brand Identity Reflecting its Mission of Powering Innovative Retirement Solutions",
  "summary": "DALLAS, Aug. 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — NexAnnuity today announced the launch of its refreshed brand identity, including a new logo, product positioning and materials, and website at nexannuity.com. The rebrand marks the next chapter for the retirement solutions business, which was founded in 2018 and has expanded its annuity platform, product set, and distribution footprint over the past several years. The new brand […]",
